// Evaluation weights of Albatross, the single source of truth. Included several times with different macros
// (struct definition, registry of tunable parameters), so every entry must be one complete macro call.
//
//   SCORE(name, mg, eg)         a pair of middlegame / endgame values
//   INT(name, value)            one integer
//   ARRAY(name, size, values..) integers indexed by piece type (0 = none ... 6 = king), relative rank or square
//
// Tables are written from White's point of view, rank 1 first and file A first (LERF, A1 = 0); Black uses the
// vertically mirrored square. The values are the result of the self-play tuning described in
// engine/docs/0.5-tuning.md (tools/tuner); hand-written starting points before that.

// ---- material (centipawns). The pawn middlegame value is the anchor of the scale and is never tuned ----
ARRAY(materialMg, 7, 0, 100, 361, 378, 502, 1349, 0)
ARRAY(materialEg, 7, 0, 82, 299, 340, 593, 960, 0)

